# {{name}}

A desktop app built with [Pebbles](https://github.com/pebbles-hq/pebbles).

## Develop

```sh
pebbles run                 # build + run with rich logs; hot-restarts on save
pebbles run --log trace     # more detail
```

## Release

```sh
pebbles run --release
# or a plain cargo build:
cargo build --release
```

## Where to look next

- `src/main.rs` — the whole app: a component function, a signal, a handler.
- [Pebbles README](https://github.com/pebbles-hq/pebbles) — the programming
  model, the widget catalog, and the platform-support matrix.
